BaseVault_getTVL
├── when there is no active adapter
│   └── it should return 0
└── when there is an active adapter
    ├── on ParentVault
    │   └── it should return the adapter TVL
    │       └── when adapter TVL is zero
    │           └── it should return the rebalance deposit recovery amount
    └── on ChildVault
        └── it should return adapter TVL plus epoch deposit recovery
            └── when adapter TVL is zero
                └── it should return the epoch deposit recovery amount
